<title>UK: Eskom sets 150 mln rand five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Eskom sets 150 mln rand five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ESKOM LTD</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.0 PCT  MATURITY    03.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.75    PAY DATE    03.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY     *BAA1	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	 *BBB+	DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  S.AFRICA  TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.5	 SELL CONC  1.5	 PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	*ESKOM DEBT DENOMINATED IN RAND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
